      "thesis": "RSI(2) on 1-min bars reaches extreme levels (<5 or >95) relatively frequently and these extremes revert quickly. The very short 2-period RSI captures momentum exhaustion at the micro level \u2014 when RSI(2) < 5, price has closed lower than the previous close for 2 consecutive bars with large magnitude, ",
